WEBVTT

00:03.710 --> 00:06.670
Helck learns about
the dangers of awakening,

00:06.670 --> 00:08.880
including that Cless
is being used against his will

00:08.880 --> 00:11.750
to further a plan
that could destroy the kingdom,

00:11.750 --> 00:13.250
and goes to rescue him.

00:13.250 --> 00:16.540
However, Cless falls under the control
of the king's spell

00:16.540 --> 00:18.580
and begins to mercilessly attack Helck.

00:18.580 --> 00:19.880
Just in the nick of time,

00:19.880 --> 00:22.380
Alicia uses the blade of her Hero Slayer
to deal a blow to Cless

00:22.380 --> 00:24.420
that quickly stops his rampage.

00:24.420 --> 00:28.670
But then, her sword
gets stolen by Mikaros.

00:29.170 --> 00:30.960
I'm going to borrow this.

00:33.920 --> 00:35.460
You amateurs.

00:35.460 --> 00:36.710
This is what happens...

00:38.670 --> 00:40.420
when you underestimate my power.

01:06.540 --> 01:09.080
Ah, displaying strength like it was totally natural

01:09.080 --> 01:11.250
Feelings of inferiority growing deeper

01:11.250 --> 01:13.210
From the moment of birth

01:13.210 --> 01:15.380
Let them know that it's a done deal

01:15.380 --> 01:17.130
The neighbor to utopia

01:17.130 --> 01:19.330
Despair is saying "hello," ya see

01:19.330 --> 01:21.380
The fact that nobody notices

01:21.380 --> 01:23.540
Is it for better or worse?

01:23.540 --> 01:26.750
No matter how many times I wake up

01:26.750 --> 01:29.880
It's like I'm in a nightmare

01:29.880 --> 01:33.250
If suffering is all there is

01:33.580 --> 01:35.380
Then God could you please

01:35.380 --> 01:39.290
Consider remaking me from scratch?

01:39.290 --> 01:41.420
Ah, for many thousands of years we have

01:41.420 --> 01:44.000
Been holding out hope for the future

01:44.000 --> 01:45.920
The end is bound to come no matter what

01:45.920 --> 01:48.210
And we try to resist it

01:48.210 --> 01:49.880
How many prayers is this now?

01:49.880 --> 01:52.210
Body and soul completely transformed

01:52.210 --> 01:56.630
Just wanting to believe in something even if it's fake

01:56.750 --> 02:00.130
Huh? Am I alive right now?

02:00.130 --> 02:02.880
I don't even know anymore

02:02.880 --> 02:04.880
Help me, I need to be saved

02:18.040 --> 02:22.960
<b>Traitors</b>

02:35.630 --> 02:39.290
What the hell?!
Th-this pain is so intense!

02:39.790 --> 02:42.790
I feel like... I'm gonna pass out...

02:48.880 --> 02:52.960
I fully intended to make that a fatal blow
by hitting your vitals, you know.

02:53.170 --> 02:57.380
It's most impressive that
you were able to react before I struck.

02:57.960 --> 03:01.960
But I must say, the power of the
cursed Hero Slayer is mighty indeed.

03:02.210 --> 03:04.330
All I did was pierce your shoulder,

03:04.330 --> 03:07.750
but that seems to have dealt enough damage
to be incapacitating.

03:07.920 --> 03:10.460
I've never seen Sir Helck
in pain like that!

03:10.460 --> 03:12.960
I'm betting it's because
of that magic sword!

03:14.290 --> 03:15.920
Helck must be a hero, too.

03:17.540 --> 03:20.830
Not to mention, did you notice
the way Master Mikaros moved?

03:20.830 --> 03:23.540
He had the same dark aura
around him as Cless.

03:26.500 --> 03:29.080
That man is more than just
an ordinary human!

03:29.080 --> 03:30.330
Damn Mikaros!

03:30.330 --> 03:33.000
He's been holding out on us
this entire time!

03:33.500 --> 03:36.290
Come on, Helck. Be reasonable.

03:36.290 --> 03:39.500
Why don't you just give up
and come over to our side?

03:39.750 --> 03:41.830
Considering the feats
that you're capable of,

03:41.830 --> 03:45.250
you'll prove more than useful
in my master plan.

03:45.460 --> 03:48.000
Let's join forces and change the world.

03:48.000 --> 03:51.580
We'll remake everything until
it's the way that it was meant to be.

03:52.080 --> 03:54.380
Y-you're telling me...

03:54.380 --> 03:57.080
turning the innocent people of this land

03:57.080 --> 04:00.330
into mindless slaves
is how the world was meant to be?

04:05.290 --> 04:06.920
THAT'S BULLSHIT!

04:10.500 --> 04:12.380
I'm honestly impressed.

04:12.380 --> 04:15.750
Just look at how much you can still
move around despite that grave injury.

04:17.330 --> 04:20.880
I know I just went out of my way
to invite you to our side...

04:20.880 --> 04:25.630
but in all my time, I've actually never
gotten along with people like you.

04:25.830 --> 04:27.750
So even if I share my
true motives with you,

04:27.750 --> 04:31.880
I'm positive that you'll still stand
against me in the end.

04:35.290 --> 04:38.420
I'm almost certain that you'll die
if I just left you here,

04:38.420 --> 04:42.000
but it's safer to kill you
beyond a doubt while I have the chance.

04:43.250 --> 04:44.080
Sir Helck!

04:44.080 --> 04:45.330
Dammit! Outta the way!

04:45.960 --> 04:47.290
Helck!

04:52.080 --> 04:53.250
Now die.

05:19.500 --> 05:22.080
I didn't think you'd
come back to your senses...

05:22.080 --> 05:23.960
that was a mistake on my part.

05:24.580 --> 05:27.830
But it's already too late for you!

05:32.670 --> 05:33.790
What?!

05:34.630 --> 05:35.880
Cless...

05:38.170 --> 05:41.210
H-has he broken free
from the mind control?

05:41.210 --> 05:42.880
I hereby order you.

05:43.670 --> 05:45.830
Cless the Hero.

05:45.830 --> 05:46.960
Not good!

05:46.960 --> 05:49.000
Take the traitorous Helck...

05:49.460 --> 05:50.380
and kil-

05:53.540 --> 05:54.500
No!

05:54.500 --> 05:55.920
Cless, you bastard!

05:55.920 --> 05:56.750
Your Majesty!

05:56.750 --> 05:58.250
This can't be happening!

06:02.790 --> 06:05.040
Take the traitorous Helck...

06:05.630 --> 06:06.920
and kill him!

06:17.630 --> 06:18.670
This doesn't make sense!

06:18.670 --> 06:20.790
How can the king still give orders
with a hole in his head?!

06:29.920 --> 06:31.420
He's going for Hero Slayer...

06:31.420 --> 06:32.750
N-no, don't!

06:33.000 --> 06:34.130
Please stop!

06:43.540 --> 06:44.670
Kill him!

06:44.670 --> 06:45.500
Kill him!

06:45.500 --> 06:46.750
Kill him!

06:53.920 --> 06:55.000
Sir Cless!

06:55.130 --> 06:56.830
Cless! Don't do this!

06:57.080 --> 07:00.290
Please no! Don't kill Helck!

07:16.330 --> 07:18.630
Helck... I'm sorry.

07:19.170 --> 07:21.170
I've caused you nothing but trouble.

07:27.500 --> 07:29.460
Hold... on...

07:29.460 --> 07:32.420
Please... don't... do this...

08:00.460 --> 08:02.580
He was a champion of the people...

08:02.580 --> 08:05.170
who was fighting for everyone
to have peace...

08:06.420 --> 08:08.460
So how does this make any sense?

08:09.420 --> 08:13.670
Where are the demonkin?
The Demon Lord? The monsters?

08:14.630 --> 08:16.330
There are no enemies here.

08:17.630 --> 08:20.210
Everyone should be on our side!

08:21.500 --> 08:22.790
And yet...

08:23.130 --> 08:25.670
Why? Why?!

08:29.460 --> 08:34.080
Why is it... that Cless has to die here?

08:34.580 --> 08:36.330
Worthless piece of shit!

08:36.330 --> 08:37.630
The goddamn fool!

08:37.630 --> 08:41.380
Not only does he harm the king,
but then he goes and kills himself!

08:41.380 --> 08:43.460
What will happen to the plan now?!

08:43.630 --> 08:45.540
Can we find a replacement?

08:45.540 --> 08:47.540
It doesn't even matter
how rare his ability is,

08:47.540 --> 08:49.540
because he's still another one
of those lowborn vermin!

08:49.540 --> 08:51.290
They're just too damn stupid!

08:51.290 --> 08:53.880
Nothing but useless sacks of crap!

09:00.130 --> 09:01.960
"Sacks of crap"?

09:09.380 --> 09:10.330
Uh oh!

09:11.500 --> 09:15.250
Who are you... calling a sack of crap?!

09:15.250 --> 09:16.330
What is going on?!

09:16.540 --> 09:19.210
He's using the same powers that Cless had!

09:19.210 --> 09:21.000
Go, awakened soldiers!

09:21.000 --> 09:22.460
There is nothing to fear!

09:22.460 --> 09:25.540
He's already on the verge of death
from the wound that Mikaros gave him!

09:25.540 --> 09:26.380
That's right!

09:26.380 --> 09:29.170
Th-there's no way he has
enough strength to reach us!

09:30.000 --> 09:31.210
Speak.

09:31.580 --> 09:33.380
Who are you calling stupid?

09:34.540 --> 09:36.630
WHO ARE YOU CALLING A SACK OF CRAP?!

09:37.580 --> 09:39.130
Wh-what is happening?!

09:39.130 --> 09:41.750
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! Please spare me!

09:41.750 --> 09:44.920
H-hurry and do something,
awakened soldiers!

09:46.670 --> 09:48.500
What's wrong with the soldiers?!

09:48.500 --> 09:50.250
Kill that lowlife!

09:52.790 --> 09:54.040
Tell me...

09:54.750 --> 09:58.250
What makes you assholes
so much better than the rest of us?

09:58.880 --> 10:01.040
What the hell is so special about you?!

10:02.040 --> 10:05.000
Cless is not a tool for you to use!

10:06.670 --> 10:09.000
He's my younger brother!

10:10.580 --> 10:12.460
THE ONLY FAMILY I HAVE!

10:15.920 --> 10:18.130
You bastards exploited him...

10:18.130 --> 10:20.500
I-I can't stop shaking.

10:20.500 --> 10:22.540
I'm scared, so scared!

10:22.540 --> 10:23.710
Sir Helck...

10:23.710 --> 10:25.460
C-calm down, Helck!

10:25.750 --> 10:29.290
You used him for nothing
but your stupid, sick bullshit!

10:30.290 --> 10:32.830
Please! You gotta stop this, Helck!

10:32.830 --> 10:34.330
We can't take anymore!

10:35.040 --> 10:36.670
I'm going...

10:36.670 --> 10:38.750
TO SLAUGHTER EVERY LAST ONE OF YOU FUC-

10:43.580 --> 10:46.250
Helck. I'm sorry.

10:46.710 --> 10:49.960
My sword is what's causing you
so much pain and grief.

10:50.460 --> 10:53.500
It stole the life
of your precious little brother.

10:54.250 --> 10:55.630
Please forgive me.

10:56.790 --> 10:57.460
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

10:57.460 --> 11:00.830
No... this isn't your fault...
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.<b></b>

11:01.330 --> 11:04.040
It's mine... I'm the one...

11:04.040 --> 11:06.130
who couldn't save him.

11:20.380 --> 11:22.500
Is... is it over?

11:28.750 --> 11:31.380
Helck. Let's go home.

11:31.380 --> 11:33.210
You need to get patched up.

11:34.170 --> 11:35.540
It's all right.

11:35.540 --> 11:37.790
I'm going to keep you safe.

11:38.880 --> 11:40.750
So just rest for now.

11:41.420 --> 11:43.080
D-don't let them escape!

11:43.580 --> 11:44.790
Awakened soldiers!

11:44.790 --> 11:47.330
Attack! Kill Helck now!

11:47.330 --> 11:49.960
I don't care what it takes,
I want him dead!

11:49.960 --> 11:51.080
That's not going to happen!

11:51.080 --> 11:52.460
You'll have to go through me
to get to him!

11:52.460 --> 11:54.420
Hey now! Don't forget about us!

11:55.040 --> 11:56.250
You guys...

11:56.250 --> 11:57.880
Just leave Helck to me!

11:57.880 --> 11:59.960
You two keep the awakened soldiers at bay!

12:00.210 --> 12:02.500
Quit wasting time against these nobodies!

12:05.540 --> 12:06.880
Cless...

12:07.420 --> 12:08.670
Cless...

12:10.330 --> 12:11.960
Please stop!

12:11.960 --> 12:13.750
It hurts! It hurts!

12:14.130 --> 12:14.670
Ow!

12:14.670 --> 12:15.630
C'mon already!
Ow!<b></b>

12:15.630 --> 12:16.880
I thought you wanted to be
a tough warrior!
That hurts!<b></b>

12:16.880 --> 12:18.210
I thought you wanted to be
a tough warrior!

12:19.880 --> 12:22.580
Hey! You stay away from Cless!

12:27.000 --> 12:28.210
D-damn you!

12:28.210 --> 12:30.210
You're gonna pay
for messing with nobles like us!

12:30.210 --> 12:32.790
I better not catch you
harassing Cless ever again!

12:32.790 --> 12:34.210
Or you're dead meat!

12:36.630 --> 12:37.790
Are you okay?

12:37.790 --> 12:38.630
Yeah!

12:38.630 --> 12:40.210
That was awesome, Big Bro!

12:40.210 --> 12:41.960
You punched that noble in the face!

12:42.170 --> 12:43.710
But they'll be back.

12:43.710 --> 12:46.210
And who knows what they'll do next?

12:46.960 --> 12:48.920
I'm so afraid...

12:48.920 --> 12:50.290
It's all right.

12:50.290 --> 12:53.790
I'm going to protect you
no matter what happens.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.580
Whenever you find yourself in trouble,

12:55.580 --> 12:58.420
you can count on me
to come and save you, okay?

12:58.960 --> 12:59.920
Okay!

12:59.920 --> 13:02.500
Gosh, Big Bro, I always
feel better with you around!

13:02.500 --> 13:03.790
You're the coolest!

13:05.920 --> 13:07.670
Alright, let's go home.

13:09.330 --> 13:11.460
We're gonna have something yummy today!

13:11.460 --> 13:12.750
Really? Hooray!

13:13.040 --> 13:14.580
What would you like?

13:14.580 --> 13:16.330
Let me think.

13:18.710 --> 13:20.170
It can be whatever you want!

13:20.170 --> 13:21.920
I'll make anything!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.250
Huh?

13:27.250 --> 13:29.290
Where did you go, Cless?

13:29.880 --> 13:31.080
Cless?

13:34.250 --> 13:36.540
Cless! Get out here!

13:36.540 --> 13:38.500
Hey! Come on!

13:41.710 --> 13:44.500
Oh jeez. I guess he went home ahead of me.

13:45.290 --> 13:48.920
Hey, Cless.
Don't just leave me behind like that.

14:02.580 --> 14:06.380
I went on and on about
"saving" him and "protecting" him...

14:08.460 --> 14:10.830
but it was just a bunch of empty talk.

14:10.830 --> 14:15.000
Cless was right in front of me.
Close enough for me to reach him.

14:15.580 --> 14:18.880
But I still couldn't do a damn thing
to save his life!

14:19.210 --> 14:22.460
I'm sorry... I'm sorry... Cless....

14:23.420 --> 14:26.290
Forgive me... Cless...

14:26.540 --> 14:27.750
Cless...

14:48.000 --> 14:49.460
It was real...

14:51.290 --> 14:54.290
I wasn't just... having a nightmare.

15:14.830 --> 15:17.460
Where is everybody?

15:18.290 --> 15:21.830
Edil? Zeru? Alicia?

15:22.420 --> 15:25.000
Are you here? Where did you go?

15:25.000 --> 15:26.960
Hey, did you hear a voice just now?

15:26.960 --> 15:29.130
Shaddup! And keep looking!

15:37.580 --> 15:40.290
Where am I right now?

15:40.290 --> 15:42.540
And where is everybody else?

15:43.380 --> 15:45.290
Look! There he is!

15:45.290 --> 15:47.080
That's totally the guy, I'm sure of it!

15:47.080 --> 15:49.130
It's Helck the Hero Slayer!

15:51.130 --> 15:53.380
He's got the world's biggest bounty
on his head!

15:53.380 --> 15:54.500
Hey, hold up!

15:54.500 --> 15:55.880
You're not getting away!

15:56.960 --> 15:58.380
Lucky!

15:58.380 --> 16:01.130
This guy looks like
he's already on his last legs!

16:01.790 --> 16:04.210
And check it out!
His eyes are totally lifeless!

16:04.210 --> 16:06.540
Is he just dead on the inside or what?!

16:06.540 --> 16:07.670
Now I get it.

16:07.670 --> 16:10.330
This must be the reason why all
his buddies fought tooth and nail

16:10.330 --> 16:11.790
like a pack of mutts.

16:12.250 --> 16:15.540
My friends? They were fighting?

16:15.960 --> 16:18.250
You know who they are?

16:18.250 --> 16:19.920
We've only heard stories!

16:19.920 --> 16:22.290
The traitor Helck and his nefarious band!

16:22.500 --> 16:25.540
People say they did whatever it took
to make sure you escaped,

16:25.540 --> 16:28.540
fighting to the bitter end like demons
straight outta Hell,

16:28.540 --> 16:30.630
broken bones and
flesh wounds be damned!

16:30.630 --> 16:33.210
Hold on! Why am I explaining this to YOU?

16:33.210 --> 16:35.380
You should already know if you were there!

16:35.380 --> 16:37.130
Did you sleep through
the whole thing or what?!

16:38.580 --> 16:39.580
Helck...

16:42.630 --> 16:45.420
Please... please...

16:49.040 --> 16:50.420
You have to survive.

16:57.040 --> 17:00.080
That's right... I saw them...

17:00.080 --> 17:04.250
I was barely hanging onto consciousness,
watching things unfold in a haze!

17:04.710 --> 17:07.750
They all risked their lives
to help me escape...

17:07.750 --> 17:08.880
But I...

17:09.500 --> 17:12.210
My body just wouldn't move
no matter what I did!

17:14.290 --> 17:17.130
I was only joking when I said it,
but I guess this fool really was sleeping

17:17.130 --> 17:19.750
while all his buddies wore themselves
down to the bone fighting!

17:19.750 --> 17:21.750
And now he's freaking out about it!

17:21.750 --> 17:23.710
Shucks, what a lucky guy!

17:23.710 --> 17:25.330
Wish I was him!

17:28.880 --> 17:30.710
These guys are right.

17:32.790 --> 17:35.830
What the hell was I doing sleeping
while all my friends

17:35.830 --> 17:38.250
were putting themselves in danger?!

17:38.460 --> 17:41.880
I shouldn't have let a cut on the shoulder
put me out of commission like that!

17:41.880 --> 17:44.880
Especially not while everybody else
was fighting for my sake!

17:44.880 --> 17:46.880
I saw it happening right in front of me!

17:47.040 --> 17:48.790
I was watching...

17:48.790 --> 17:51.420
but once again,
I couldn't do a damn thing!

17:52.710 --> 17:54.830
Some warrior I am!

17:54.830 --> 17:57.880
It doesn't mean jack if I have the power
to defeat thousands of monsters!

17:57.880 --> 18:00.500
Because when it came down to it,

18:00.500 --> 18:04.210
I wasn't able to protect or save a single
one of the people who I hold dear!

18:04.670 --> 18:06.710
There was always more than one way!

18:06.710 --> 18:08.670
There had to be a chance
for me to make a difference!

18:08.670 --> 18:12.170
It should have been possible
for there to be a happy ending!

18:12.380 --> 18:16.330
But now this whole mess... is my fault!

18:16.330 --> 18:18.170
Me! I'm the one to blame!

18:18.580 --> 18:20.670
Dammit! Dammit!

18:20.670 --> 18:23.750
Heh! Miserable friggin' meathead!

18:23.750 --> 18:25.960
It's time for you to give up the ghost.

18:26.210 --> 18:29.170
I'll just kill you nice and quick, eh?

18:29.920 --> 18:32.330
But hey, don't feel too bad about it.

18:32.330 --> 18:35.250
Because it won't be very long until all
your stupid buddies join you down in Hell!

18:36.580 --> 18:39.250
Not very long... until they join me?

18:43.460 --> 18:44.710
What does that mean?!

18:44.710 --> 18:46.080
Please tell me!

18:46.080 --> 18:48.250
Are you saying my friends
are still alive?!

18:48.250 --> 18:52.170
Uh... well, all of the traitors
are facing public execution.

18:52.170 --> 18:55.250
So they've gotta be hanging on
by a thread in some prison or whatever.

18:55.250 --> 18:57.330
What's it matter to you, huh?!

18:57.330 --> 18:59.710
You're not getting off
with busting my partner's club!

18:59.710 --> 19:01.170
Say you're sorry, dammit!

19:01.170 --> 19:02.920
It shouldn't break easily...

19:03.130 --> 19:05.580
Okay... that's great!

19:07.210 --> 19:09.960
They're not dead yet. Hope is still alive!

19:10.540 --> 19:13.210
Fat chance you make it
all the way there in time, fool!

19:13.210 --> 19:16.380
Shaddup! Don't provoke him!
Do you wanna die?!

19:16.630 --> 19:19.330
That guy is BIG trouble
when he gets pissed off.

19:19.330 --> 19:20.790
Trust me, I can tell.

19:20.790 --> 19:22.580
Don't say a word! Ignore him!

19:25.920 --> 19:27.670
I'm not giving up.

19:27.670 --> 19:30.380
I'm never going to giving up
no matter what!

19:30.710 --> 19:33.580
This time... things will be different!

19:50.210 --> 19:53.830
Hey, what was that dream

19:53.830 --> 19:57.040
We used to fantasize about?

19:57.670 --> 20:01.630
A treasured memory even if it's small

20:01.630 --> 20:05.040
And covered in mud

20:05.790 --> 20:09.500
I was so clumsy that

20:09.500 --> 20:12.580
I couldn't even tell left from right

20:13.540 --> 20:20.420
When those clear eyes took my hand and saved me

20:21.500 --> 20:25.380
It's okay, it's okay, you kept saying

20:25.380 --> 20:29.330
As you hugged me tightly over and over

20:29.330 --> 20:32.710
This time I will be the one to grab ahold

20:32.710 --> 20:35.920
Of your warm hand

20:37.170 --> 20:44.330
I shouted your name and the world laughed

20:44.630 --> 20:48.580
Those words that hold us together

20:48.580 --> 20:51.710
Are the most precious of all

20:52.830 --> 21:00.000
If this is going to be our fate, then let's change it

21:00.250 --> 21:04.250
On the other side of the darkness

21:04.250 --> 21:11.290
We shall seize the light together

21:12.080 --> 21:18.130
<b>Helck the Topless Trooper</b>

21:12.750 --> 21:14.500
He's a bit of an oddball,

21:14.500 --> 21:17.420
but Helck the Topless Trooper
has joined our ranks.

21:18.170 --> 21:20.080
Oh crap! Monster attack!

21:20.080 --> 21:21.130
KABLAMO!

21:22.000 --> 21:23.790
I'm starving!

21:23.790 --> 21:25.250
KABLAMO!

21:25.630 --> 21:27.460
There's a leak in the roof!

21:27.460 --> 21:28.790
KABLAMO!

21:28.790 --> 21:30.880
Every move that he makes
goes "kablamo," huh?

21:32.750 --> 21:34.960
Wow, he has so many different skills.

21:34.960 --> 21:37.290
And jeez, just look at that huge smile.

21:38.040 --> 21:41.250
You've gotta be tired from all
the fighting we've been doing, right?

21:41.250 --> 21:42.790
Just take a break.

21:42.790 --> 21:44.130
No worries!

21:44.130 --> 21:46.670
I've got way more stamina than
your average guy.

21:46.670 --> 21:48.630
So this is nothing for me.

21:48.960 --> 21:52.540
Besides, keeping busy
actually makes me feel at ease.

21:54.380 --> 21:56.420
Helck the Topless Trooper.

21:56.420 --> 21:58.500
Although it seems like he can do anything,

21:58.500 --> 22:01.460
it's more like he's just a guy
that will come to help in every situation.

22:01.460 --> 22:03.000
That's my impression, anyway.

22:03.500 --> 22:05.540
There! It's all fixed!

22:05.540 --> 22:07.330
Amazing! It's perfect!

22:07.670 --> 22:08.920
Oh?

22:09.960 --> 22:11.290
The sun has come out!

22:11.960 --> 22:13.630
Look! There's a rainbow!

22:14.170 --> 22:17.080
There never seems to be a moment
when Helck is unhappy.

22:17.080 --> 22:20.210
Well, I'm sure it must happen,
but it's hard for me to know.

22:21.290 --> 22:24.330
I mean, the guy has a perpetual smile.

22:24.330 --> 22:25.960
Seriously. It never changes.

22:26.790 --> 22:29.040
I guess it's because
of the world we live in.

22:29.040 --> 22:33.290
After all, that smile on his face
always gives me peace of mind.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.540
Let's go inside, Helck.

22:35.540 --> 22:37.000
I'll make you a cup of coffee.

22:37.420 --> 22:39.170
Really? Thank you!

22:40.250 --> 22:43.500
That Helck... he's such a peculiar guy!

22:46.040 --> 22:50.830
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.830
<b>Smile</b>

22:46.880 --> 22:48.920
Next time: "Smile"
